WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- You had to make a Wakanda Forever

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.133
without Chadwick Boseman.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:04.966
- Yeah.

00:00:04.966 --> 00:00:06.833
- So did the cast, was
it kinda odd at first?

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.370
Did y'all do anything?

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.460
- Oh, when we arrived in ya know,

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.220
on the set, ya know, a
couple of days before,

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:18.240
you know, reading through
and rehearsals and stuff,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.999
it was planned.

00:00:19.999 --> 00:00:21.060
The producers and director had planned,

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:25.110
had rented a plane and we
all flew to South Carolina

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:29.250
and we went to visit
together, his resting place,

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.991
together.
- Wow.

00:00:30.991 --> 00:00:32.400
- And it was a beautiful day.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.850
His uncles were there, his cousin,

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.880
and we just, you know,
just spoke from our heart

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.523
about him, how we felt about him

00:00:41.523 --> 00:00:42.660
or times with him.
- Yeah.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.210
- You know and that was
really, really lovely,

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:47.670
a great way to just begin because ya know,

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.260
we miss him terribly.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.300
And then when we got to the set,

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.040
it was like okay, we've had this moment

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.939
of coming together and now,

00:00:55.939 --> 00:00:57.782
we've got to come to work

00:00:57.782 --> 00:01:00.526
and that's what he would
want for us. We know that!

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:01.411
- I know but it feels like the movie.

00:01:01.411 --> 00:01:03.391
It feels like that's something
you would've done in Wakanda.

00:01:03.391 --> 00:01:04.224
Like if someone passed,
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:04.224 --> 00:01:06.540
Like it feels, I'm such a fan, sorry.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.530
Keeping my cool.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.730
I'm like really excited
about the new movie.

